{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0243_1000_p", "source_sha256": "9541f2320002e3c190a130be05a828955ea1b007a14b7595858c626b64e9f93c", "ja": "（今日はグラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の撮影だ。\nそろそろ静香も着替え終わったかな……おっ！）", "zh": "（今天要拍摄写真杂志《偶像写真！！》。\n不知道静香差不多换好衣服了没有……哦！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0243_1001_015siz", "source_sha256": "30fb7dc6b00b5380bc2386207f86c4681b216170f80ea230335711b947676a4b", "ja": "…………。\nポーズは、こんな感じ、かな？", "zh": "…………。\n摆这样的姿势，可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0243_1002_p", "source_sha256": "954ce9b19b08a16691a0d0869efdb56ac6fc4b2a23350fa4c83873d299716cb7", "ja": "（…………。ふむ）", "zh": "（…………。嗯。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0243_1003_015siz", "source_sha256": "830f7dc5be983af9dc2f7dc77a8587fa4384ded2c9c2dd110cd88075306e96ed", "ja": "それとも……って、{$P$}！？\nい、いつから見てたんですか！？", "zh": "还是说……等等，{$P$}！？\n您、您从什么时候开始看的！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0243_1004_p", "source_sha256": "059b55c95ac14bef01b9c177f34f6a2f8b4c65c87bdc522e68351fab5df1d2bd", "ja": "えっ、あ、いや、今来たところで……コホン。\nそれより、ポーズの練習中か？　気合い入ってるな！", "zh": "诶，啊，不，我也是刚到……咳咳。  \n比起这个，你是在练习姿势吗？干劲十足啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0243_1005_015siz", "source_sha256": "082cbc3e80272f98846c3fa1f47ad453ceb92d3025f55e1390fed043ea7b4c13", "ja": "当たり前じゃないですか。白いワンピースって、\nごまかしがきかないんですよ。", "zh": "这不是理所当然的嘛。白色连衣裙\n可是容不得半点敷衍的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0243_1006_015siz", "source_sha256": "b16012dee3a7c74eb25c63a1cc9e6c1b3ad774533cfd2d828e715ab2b01f579e", "ja": "私自身の魅力で勝負しなきゃいけないから……。\nとにかく、覚悟がいるんです！", "zh": "因为必须凭我自己的魅力一决胜负……\n总之，需要做好觉悟才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0243_1007_p", "source_sha256": "b5a07029aa3eac69238ffb3698fd57a17762cecbc496768d0e502328921c5846", "ja": "うーん……まあ、やる気なのはありがたいけど。\nもっと自信を持ってもいいんじゃないか？", "zh": "嗯……虽然你有干劲是件好事。\n但你是不是可以再自信一点？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0243_1008_p", "source_sha256": "e082c901694427a30a92787eec1cc66c6d5552371c7c740060267111faa9d23e", "ja": "さっきだって、静香に見惚れて、\nしばらく声が掛けられなかったくらいだし。", "zh": "刚才也是因为看静香看得入迷，半天都没能叫她。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0243_1009_015siz", "source_sha256": "99bedb8995e56104dfa0e40cd499ef3c6be8b8a129b970da5b94195736e2c9a3", "ja": "えっ……そ、そうだったんですか？　本当に……？", "zh": "诶……是、是这样的吗？真的……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0243_1010_015siz", "source_sha256": "02c92a02ae433b6dc64388de89e547be1bc9e3f1102f23c3532dbb08014a5e92", "ja": "って、それってやっぱり、\nずっと見てたって事じゃないですか！", "zh": "等等，也就是说，果然一直都在看着我吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0243_1011_p", "source_sha256": "fb9011ecf62d866c93370ddbf128d622f02e8073679a4e88dc03e0f3e2068841", "ja": "え、あ、いや……。\nそれくらい魅力的だって言いたいんだ！", "zh": "诶，啊，不是……我是想说，你有那么大的魅力！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0243_1012_p", "source_sha256": "357e2d18e12d6e129201a966cdd263c73b73a9ba1e72a3ed36fa9b31d68282a8", "ja": "シンプルな衣装だからこそ、静香の魅力が\n際立っている！　そのままで十分素敵だと思うよ。", "zh": "正因为是简约的服装，静香的魅力才更加突出！我觉得保持这样就已经很棒了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0243_1013_015siz", "source_sha256": "1c0b3bb0ba130e8d7bcc348d6042758a1bd2d551f7e4d8a1042a8728d2f857f8", "ja": "はあ……調子よすぎませんか？\n気合い入れてたのが、バカみたいじゃないですか。", "zh": "哈啊……您是不是说得太过头了？\n搞得我之前那么认真准备，反倒像个傻瓜一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0243_1014_015siz", "source_sha256": "a39a902505d9510cd903803b4e35e0621c2798f3b94dd05e19f2ee30501b78a8", "ja": "{$P$}が選んでくれた衣装だから、\n頑張らなくちゃって……あっ。", "zh": "因为是{$P$}帮我挑选的服装，所以我得努力才行……啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0243_1015_p", "source_sha256": "cefa90a7afa6b1f1c7e3fe1a7a07549df2f8fb591132e88b1a1abf7ca820ee16", "ja": "静香……！", "zh": "静香……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0243_1016_015siz", "source_sha256": "a473a688714ab75cc45c12603d7b0c17fd00818def994bd2aaee73ed9559cc7e", "ja": "も、もう……これだけ褒めて、その気に\nさせたんですから。ちゃんと責任、取ってくださいね！", "zh": "真、真是的……既然夸了我这么多，让我产生了干劲，就要好好负起责任来哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0243_1017_015siz", "source_sha256": "6d8640ab6eb39698b6f071efa62293e54f36ddd8620c079815d5546f65f5edd2", "ja": "今日の撮影、最後まで目を離しちゃダメですよ？\n{$P$}が選んだ衣装なんですから！", "zh": "今天的拍摄，你可不许看到最后还移开视线哦？毕竟这可是{$P$}选的服装嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0243_1018_p", "source_sha256": "1cf27461f086e85e250b76eb703af74fa8b117f809770046fcf014790dbcd355", "ja": "（静香、肩の力が抜けたみたいだな。\nこれならきっと、いい写真になるだろう！）", "zh": "（静香好像放松下来了。这样一来，一定能拍出很棒的照片！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
